  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">• About our brand and products: </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">ENERGY SKIN is next‑generation functional apparel engineered to elevate human performance. Our products combine advanced textile technology with minimalist design, delivering comfort, mobility, and real‑world benefits for athletes, creators, and everyday movers. We focus on science‑backed innovation, clean aesthetics, and gear that works as hard as the people who wear it.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br>• What makes us different: We don’t follow trends — we build performance from the inside out. ENERGY SKIN blends technology, design, and purpose into apparel that enhances how the body feels and performs. Our brand stands for authenticity, innovation, and a community of people who believe in progress. This isn’t fast fashion. It’s functional gear with intention.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn: Affiliates earn commissions on every sale made through their unique referral link or discount code. The more you share and the more your audience engages, the more you earn. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br>• How to promote us: Share your authentic experience with ENERGY SKIN — through training content, lifestyle posts, product reviews, or everyday moments. Use your unique link or code in captions, stories, blogs, videos, and conversations. We encourage creativity, honesty, and content that reflects your real performance lifestyle</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br>• Other information: ENERGY SKIN partners are part of a selective community. We look for individuals who align with our values, represent the brand with integrity, and genuinely believe in our mission. Affiliates receive brand guidelines, product education, and ongoing support to help them grow their impact and earnings.</span></p></div></div>",
